# OIDC documentation governance

`oidc-docs/` is **product-local** for Sakrylle CLI only.

## Canonical platform docs

`../../sub2api/sakrylle-docs/`:

- `10-platform-identity/current-state.md`
- `10-platform-identity/rp-integration-guide.md`
- `10-platform-identity/commercial-boundaries.md`
- `10-platform-identity/configuration-isolation.md`

## Allowed local files

- `oidc-docs/README.md`
- `oidc-docs/local-integration.md`
- `oidc-docs/implementation-status.md`
- `oidc-docs/troubleshooting.md`
- `oidc-docs/historical/` (preserved research/plans)

Do **not** copy provider endpoints, claims policy, roadmap, risk register, or design system content here — link to center docs.

## When to update

Changing CLI auth, `SAKRYLLE_CLI_HOME`, provider defaults, OAuth/OIDC login, token storage, refresh/revoke/logout, or Responses API compatibility:

1. Update local `oidc-docs/` notes
2. Update `../../sub2api/sakrylle-docs/` when the platform contract changes
